  designNotes: 'Beat 7: TOUGHNESS is the new variable. The chart asked for wind here;
    wind is cosmetic in this build (drifts in Z, collision is X/Y) so it would have
    taught a lie. Heavy riflemen at 64 hp instead: two volleys apiece, so spreading
    fire stops working and concentration becomes mandatory rather than merely efficient.
    First use of HeavyRifleman and Grenadier anywhere in the campaign.'
